   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello, I am new in the distance sampling method and I have data of 3 areas (with different transects, which are in the sample label) and during 3 years.<div>How do I get the density of each year for each area?</div><div>I can&#39;t see anywhere how to get the detection curve with the data of all years for each area.</div><div><br></div><div>Can you help me? Thank you</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dtfXlvqBAgAJ",
   "from": "Eric Rexstad",
   "author": "75e0b0abcbafbc7d",
   "date": "2024-07-04T10:22:46Z",
   "subject": "Re: [distance-sampling] Sampling 3 areas (regions) during 3 years",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHelena</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWelcome to the list. My suggestion would be to treat each area/year combination as a stratum, resulting in nine strata in your data. You can then produce stratum-specific density estimates.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHowever, you should not assume that detectability is the same for all areas in all years. You would build a detection function model where detectability is constant across strata and a different detection function model where detectability differs between strata\r\n (fit a separate detection function for each stratum).  You will then use model selection techniques to assess which model is best for your data.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nExamples of such analyses with strata are provided</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div><a href=\"https://examples.distancesampling.org/Distance-strata/strata-distill.html\" title=\"https://examples.distancesampling.org/Distance-strata/strata-distill.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://examples.distancesampling.org/Distance-strata/strata-distill.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471811303000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0E6Mw7Wzhsni-OdNzHMi30\">here</a> using R and</div>\r\n</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div><a href=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org/online-course/syllabus/Chapter5/\" title=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org/online-course/syllabus/Chapter5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://workshops.distancesampling.org/online-course/syllabus/Chapter5/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471811303000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0syVW9R2WUPqMXl0l7q86n\">here</a> using Distance for Windows.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\" style=\"border-spacing:0px\">\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org/online-course/syllabus/Chapter5/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--themePrimary)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://workshops.distancesampling.org/online-course/syllabus/Chapter5/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471811303000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0syVW9R2WUPqMXl0l7q86n\">Chapter 5 Stratification, clusters and covariates</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden\">\r\nTeaching distance sampling through video lectures and computer exercises.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(166,166,166);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471811303000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0adKKzxXx44svpFyNRsQ9c\">workshops.distancesampling.org</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nYou can write to me privately if you have further questions.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Helena Navalpotro &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">helena.n...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 04 July 2024 10:59<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> distance-sampling &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [distance-sampling] Sampling 3 areas (regions) during 3 years</span>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div></div>"
